    "description": "Complete API test collection with 24 test cases.\n\n## How to Use\n1. Import this collection into Postman\n2. Set `base_url` to your server (default: http://localhost:3000)\n3. Run the collection in order — tokens chain automatically\n\n## Test Coverage\n- Auth Signup: 7 cases (incl. empty body, empty name, empty email)\n- Auth Login: 5 cases (incl. empty body, empty email)\n- Users/Me: 2 cases\n- Users/Password: 6 cases (incl. empty body, empty current, empty new)\n- Users/Picture: 3 cases (incl. empty body)\n- Heartbeat: 1 case",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "_exporter_id": "47000186",
    "_collection_link": "https://go.postman.co/collection/47000186-23d74db8-e393-4a11-9fb4-21357821f771?source=collection_link"
